// (the face formed by the bricks on black — the reference stage shows ONLY the
// brick field; the grayscale face is rasterized purely to place bricks, never
// drawn). <title>/<desc> are preserved for a11y. Pure fn of (svg, clock);
// maskId is unused (kept for call-site signature stability).
// J solid cool output: TRANSPARENT background + a CYAN whole-brick field (the
// face formed by the bricks; voids show the pane's own background). The bricks
// are wrapped in <g id=maskId> so the pane's 12fps drift interval can translate
